      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Agriculture dominates Belfry, with sugar beets, alfalfa, and feed corn the main crops and cattle and sheep ranching common.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
